OL,3,ATwo pilot whales dead after mass
OL,4,Astranding
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo pilot whales have died after a
OL,7,Fdistressed pod was spotted off the
OL,8,FNorthumberland coast.
OL,10,FBritish Divers Marine Life Rescue
OL,11,F(BDMLR) said it had been alerted to a
OL,12,Fgroup of about 40 whales near to the
OL,13,Fshore at Amble at 15:00 BST on Sunday.
OL,15,FIt said the whales had been "behaving
OL,16,Fin a distressed manner typically seen
OL,17,Fprior to a stranding event".
OL,19,FDue to the tides, attempts to refloat
OL,20,Fthe animals had been unsuccessful, the
OL,21,Fcharity said, and rescue teams were
OL,22,Fforced to withdraw.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
